= \sqrt{4.5}\,\cdot\frac{2}{5}
= \frac{2}{5}\sqrt{4.5}
= \frac{2}{5}\sqrt{\frac{9}{2}}
= \frac{2}{5}\cdot\frac{3}{2}\sqrt{2}
= \frac{3}{5}\sqrt{2}
\]

